Package: alquRanid
Title: Indonesian Quran Data for R and Quarto
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
  person("Yandi", "Andiyana", email = "e-mail = artofmuslimness@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides Indonesian Quran translation and Arabic Quran text for
  access, search, analysis, and use in Quarto documents. The package
  provides functions for retrieving individual verses or surahs and
  searching the Indonesian translation.
